        "command": "bash tools/run_python_project_data.sh docs/checkpoints/PERL-PRIVATE-FACTORY-CAPTURE.3.2.1.11-publish-claim.py; review.py, evidence.py and book-review.py have readonly defaults. Capture/population/run/fault/book/current/preservation writers are retired.",
        "granularity": "Every20 named public case/header/native channel; identical80 assertion names/plans;16 original failures; three source faults and their14/2/16 distinguishing failures; two semantic corruption/restoration pairs; complete1485 original Markdown byte inputs/1349 facts and six exact current overlays;534 original bindings/full123810 publication;89 book inputs/four controls; two named metadata projection reproductions.",
        "result": "Knowledge header list association is repaired: only empty-value keys own following block items; scalar and inline values close association, and malformed scalar answers remain visible to denial. Identical20-case/80-assertion public checker proof changes16 original REDs/64 controls to all GREEN. Three actual source controls fail14/2/16 with complete plans and exact restoration; two semantic evidence corruptions reject and restore. Full original1485 Markdown inputs/1349 facts are retained in a recoverable capsule; the current full gate passes with six planned header overlays and unchanged fact bodies. Original534 bindings/full123810-byte callback publication and actual readonly baseline are preserved at328b11c5. Book89 inputs/four render controls pass."
      },
